{{!-- /the-faith-received/ — the project's landing page.

     Rebuilt 2026-08-20. This was a nine-section tab shell; it is now a
     landing page, and the browsing it used to hold lives at
     /the-faith-received/browse/. The band language is documented in
     website/handoffs/TFR-REDESIGN.md.

