        <h3 class="faith-card-title"><em>The Didache</em></h3>
        <p class="faith-card-desc">16 chapters of early Christian teaching on ethics, worship, and church life.</p>
        <span class="faith-card-link">Read <span class="faith-card-arrow">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
